{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>What is in your hand.</b> It lacks the letter ה (heh) to allude that no more than five signs were performed by means of the staff — and they are: the serpent, the hail, the locusts, the darkness, and the splitting of the Sea of Reeds. The rest, which were not performed by means of the staff — some were by the Holy One, blessed be He, and some were by Aharon.<br> <b>And in the Midrash:</b> ״מזה בידך״ — מזה שבידך אתה עתיד ללקות, 'with what is in your hand you are destined to be struck.'"], :book :exodus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:55:57.418672269Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}